<section id="doc-en">
  <h1>LG Extended - Documentation</h1>

  <h2>Project Summary</h2>
  <p>Xposed module for LG devices (mainly V60) that customizes the system without modifying firmware.</p>

  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Name</td><td>LG Extended</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Package</td><td><code>com.zxerox.lg_extended</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Min SDK</td><td>Android 10 (API 29)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Framework</td><td>Xposed API 82+</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Requirements</td><td>LSPosed + Root (Magisk/KernelSU/APatch)</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>Key Features</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Battery icon customization (iOS 26, iOS 17, OneUI 8, OneUI 9)</li>
    <li>Per-app DPI adjustment</li>
    <li>iOS-style multitasking</li>
    <li>FLAG_SECURE bypass for screenshots</li>
    <li>Custom Settings icons</li>
    <li>Profile card in Settings</li>
  </ul>

  <hr />

  <h2>Architecture</h2>
  <p><code>MainHook.java</code> is the entry point that registers hooks based on the target package.</p>

  <h3>Hook Lifecycle</h3>
  <ol>
    <li><code>MainHook.initZygote()</code> - Stores <code>MODULE_PATH</code></li>
    <li><code>handleLoadPackage()</code> - Detects package and registers hooks</li>
    <li>Each hook registers with try/catch for safety</li>
    <li>Hooks modify behavior via <code>beforeHookedMethod</code> / <code>afterHookedMethod</code></li>
    <li>Preferences stored via <code>ModPrefs</code> ContentProvider</li>
    <li>MainHook marks successful hooks with <code>hook_active_{'{name}'}</code></li>
  </ol>

  <h3>Target Packages</h3>
  <pre><code set:html={`"com.android.systemui" / "com.lge.systemui"
  → QSPanelHook, ScrimHook, NotificationHook, BatteryHook

"com.lge.launcher3" / "com.android.launcher3"
  → RecentsHook, LauncherHook

"android"
  → FlagSecureHook

"com.android.settings"
  → SettingsHook

Any package (except the app itself)
  → DpiHook`}></code></pre>

  <h3>Communication (ModPrefs)</h3>
  <p>ContentProvider <code>content://com.zxerox.lg_extended.prefs/prefs</code></p>
  <pre><code set:html={`// Write from UI
ContentValues values = new ContentValues();
values.put("key", "battery_style");
values.put("type", "string");
values.put("value", "IOS_26");
contentResolver.insert(ModPrefs.CONTENT_URI, values);

// Read from hook
Cursor c = context.getContentResolver().query(
    ModPrefs.CONTENT_URI,
    new String[]{"battery_style"},
    "string",
    new String[]{"ONEUI_8"},
    null
);
if (c != null && c.moveToFirst()) {
    String value = c.getString(0);
    c.close();
}`}></code></pre>

  <hr />

  <h2>Hooks</h2>

  <h3>3.1 BatteryHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> SystemUI | <strong>File:</strong> <code>hooks/BatteryHook.java</code></p>
  <p>Replaces <code>LGBatteryMeterView</code> with custom <code>BatteryIconView</code>.</p>
  <pre><code set:html={`// Hook 1: onAttachedToWindow - Create custom view
LGBatteryMeterView.onAttachedToWindow()
  → Hide original view
  → Create BatteryIconView
  → Insert at same position
  → Register ContentObserver for real-time changes

// Hook 2: onBatteryLevelChanged - Update state
LGBatteryMeterView.onBatteryLevelChanged(level, plugged, charging)
  → Hide original view
  → Get BatteryIconView
  → Call actualizarEstado(level, charging)`}></code></pre>

  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Style</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>ONEUI_8</code></td><td>Rounded pill (default)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>ONEUI_9</code></td><td>Loading circle</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>IOS_26</code></td><td>iOS with integrated bolt</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>IOS_17</code></td><td>iOS with border and padding</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h4>Preferences</h4>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Key</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>battery_style</code></td><td>String</td><td>Selected style</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>battery_color_fondo</code></td><td>int</td><td>Normal background color</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>battery_color_texto</code></td><td>int</td><td>Normal text color</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>battery_color_fondo_cargando</code></td><td>int</td><td>Charging background</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>battery_color_fondo_bajo</code></td><td>int</td><td>Low battery background</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>3.2 DpiHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> All apps | <strong>File:</strong> <code>hooks/DpiHook.java</code></p>
  <p>Modifies DPI individually before rendering.</p>
  <pre><code set:html={`ResourcesImpl.updateConfiguration(config, metrics, compatInfo)
  → Read DPI from ModPrefs (cached)
  → Modify config.densityDpi
  → Modify metrics.densityDpi`}></code></pre>

  <h3>3.3 RecentsHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> Launcher | <strong>File:</strong> <code>hooks/RecentsHook.java</code></p>
  <p>iOS-style multitasking with stack effect.</p>
  <pre><code set:html={`// Intercepted methods (10+)
TaskCornerRadius.get → Round corners to 32dp
TaskView.setFullscreenProgress → Scale based on progress
RecentsView.updateStackProperties → Main stack effect
TaskView.onFinishInflate → Remove elevation`}></code></pre>

  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>STACK_GAP</td><td>150f</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Initial scale</td><td>1.0 - 0.97</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Minimum scale</td><td>0.70</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>3.4 FlagSecureHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> android | Uses <code>XSharedPreferences</code> (not ModPrefs)</p>
  <pre><code set:html={`WindowState.isSecureLocked()
  → prefs.reload()
  → prefs.getBoolean("bypass_flag_secure", true)
  → If enabled: param.setResult(false)`}></code></pre>

  <h3>3.5 SettingsHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> com.android.settings</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Custom profile card (order = -999)</li>
    <li>18 OneUI-style icon replacements</li>
    <li>Divider removal</li>
    <li>Icon tint lock</li>
    <li>Enlarged AppBar (180dp, title 36sp)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>3.6 LauncherHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> Launcher | Sorts apps alphabetically after new install.</p>
  <pre><code set:html={`AllAppsPagedView.addApps(apps, sessionId)
  → Check hook_auto_sort_apps
  → changeSortType(SortType.NAME)`}></code></pre>

  <h3>3.7 QSPanelHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> SystemUI | Transparent background for MIUI-style QS.</p>
  <pre><code set:html={`QSContainerImpl.onFinishInflate()
  → Check pref_enable_miui_qs
  → setBackgroundColor(Color.TRANSPARENT)`}></code></pre>

  <h3>3.8 ScrimHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> SystemUI | Blur and transparency in SystemUI.</p>
  <pre><code set:html={`ScrimController.attachViews()
  → setBackgroundBlurRadius(150)
  → mDefaultScrimAlpha = 0.4f`}></code></pre>

  <h3>3.9 NotificationHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> SystemUI | MIUI style for notifications.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Blur on notification backgrounds</li>
    <li>Custom colors</li>
    <li>Hide expand arrow</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>3.10 SystemUIHook</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> SystemUI | Replaces system resources.</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Original Resource</th><th>Module Resource</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>notification_material_background_color</code></td><td><code>..._miui</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>notification_corner_radius</code></td><td><code>..._miui</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>qs_icon_size</code></td><td><code>..._miui</code></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

